{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kExnDw_QW1mrnA7SwzUF7g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:08.763326+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kExnDw_QW1mrnA7SwzUF7g","html":"<div><section><section><p><span><span><span><span>为方便广大考生提前做好推荐免试申请准备工作，我院将开通</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生和博士学位研究生（以下简称推免生）预报名系统，欢迎广大考生积极报名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>一、招生专业</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>学术学位：网络空间安全（</span></span></span><span><span><span>083900）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>专业学位：网络与信息安全（</span></span></span><span><span><span>085412）、密码（1452）</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>申请我院推免生的考生，须符合以下基本条件：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1、普通全日制应届本科毕业生，凡已取得或预计能取得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的考生均可报名；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2、遵纪守法，品行优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、学风端正，无任何考试作弊或</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学术不端行为</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>记录；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、符合我校当年招生章程和招生专业目录中规定的报考条件；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5、身心健康，符合国家及我校的相关体检要求。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>三、预报名</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>1、申请本科直博生须与拟报考导师提前联系确认。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>09：00-9月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>17:00。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2、登录山大研究生招生平台（https://yanzhao.sdu.edu.cn），选择“推免预报名”—077密码科学与工程学院，首次登录系统请注册。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、报名信息提交后，在报名时间段内如需修改信息，可点击志愿列表中“修改”按钮进行修改，修改后请再次提交。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、请认真核对报名信息，确保为提交状态，未提交的报名信息无效。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5、报名后请关注系统审核结论，如信息被退回修改，请在规定时间内按要求修改后重新提交。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6、学院将根据考生报名情况于9月中旬择优通知考生参加复试，具体复试时间、形式和复试录取办法将在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>密码科学与工程学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>网站公布。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>四、申请材料</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>1、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请攻读研究生报告，内容包括个人信息简介，学习、科研简要经历，对申请专业的认识及未来学习科研规划等；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核表；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单，须加盖学校教务主管部门公章；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5、重要</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>获奖证书；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>7、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>在校期间参军入伍服兵役、参加志愿服务、到国际组织实习等证明材料；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>8、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>回避情况说明。凡有直系亲属或利益相关人员在我校工作，尤其是在所申请推免的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>校内</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>招生单位工作的，要主动说明报备。对未按规定报备声明回避关系且影响推免过程和结果公平公正的学生，学校将取消其推免录取资格</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>9、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本人签名的诚信承诺书</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>10、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>其他</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>需要提供的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>材料</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>报名时，如以上材料暂时不能提供，可在系统内上传情况说明，避免错过报名时间。参加复试时，请将缺失材料提交学院进行补验。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>五、其他</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>1、因教育部推免相关文件暂未下达，报名系统中所列的专业信息及相关推免政策可能会有所调整。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2、我院研究生在</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>济南</span></span></strong></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>招生培养，请考生报名时注意选择。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3、通过我院复试拟接收的推免生，须登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm，开通时间详见研招网公告）填报志愿，并完成后续相关录取程序。未在规定时间内完成录取确认的推免生，将视为放弃拟录取资格。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4、未参加我院预报名的推免生，可在教育部开通“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”后，登录系统进行报名。我院将根据招生计划剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以学院通知为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><strong><span><span>六、咨询方式</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>联</span></span></span><span><span><span>系</span></span></span><span><span><span>人：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>殷</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>老师</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>15165102817</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>yinle</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>@sdu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>地址：济南市舜华路</span></span></span><span><span><span>1500号</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"41a9da714e9a4314a1d8d0d2e7674df0c66579f2f6b81361c1c4aea17e694b72","textLength":1385,"sourceSha256":"cb8a63289b6f87d9a5e4887d28eb6ddc4e59330e9be9745bc0a3f7e40c9fbb15","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-27ed0eaf9be880a1af56","title":"2026年山东大学密码科学与工程学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生和本科直博生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:08.763326+00:00"}
